Package: com.anlai97.carduo
Name: CarDuo
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Two CarPlay apps side by side on your car screen.
 Navigation and music at the same time, without switching back and forth.
 CarDuo splits the CarPlay screen into two panes, each running a real
 CarPlay app with its own native interface.
 .
 Features:
  - Run two or three CarPlay apps side by side, CarBridge apps included
  - Layouts: 2 boxes, 3 boxes, or 1 large + 2 small, switchable at any time
  - Split left/right or top/bottom and drag the divider to resize
  - Remembers the split ratio for every app pair
  - Save up to three favorite app pairs and switch with one tap
  - Open a split from the CarDuo button on the CarPlay dock or by holding an app icon
  - Reopens your last app pair when CarPlay connects
  - Control it with Siri and Shortcuts
 .
 Set it up in Settings > CarDuo, with a live preview of the car screen.
 Changes apply right away.
 .
 Compatibility: iOS 15 and later, rootless jailbreaks (Dopamine, palera1n).
Maintainer: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Author: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
Conflicts: com.anpham.splitcarplay
Replaces: com.anpham.splitcarplay
Icon: file:///var/jb/Library/PreferenceBundles/CarDuoPrefs.bundle/PackageIcon.png
